From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Electron Cordis <electron-cordis@localhost>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: build: bound dsymutil threads

Expose the thread limit of the classic DWARF linker. Its single-threaded
mode releases analysis data for each object before proceeding to the
next, reducing peak memory for large Mach-O targets.

diff --git a/build/config/apple/symbols.gni b/build/config/apple/symbols.gni
index 3682abfd2e..f74a84f8f0 100644
--- a/build/config/apple/symbols.gni
+++ b/build/config/apple/symbols.gni
@@ -16,6 +16,10 @@ declare_args() {
   # generated.
   enable_dsyms = is_official_build || using_sanitizer
 
+  # One thread lets the classic linker release analysis data after each
+  # object. Zero leaves thread selection to dsymutil.
+  dsymutil_threads = 0
+
   # Strip symbols from linked targets by default. If this is enabled, the
   # //build/config/apple:strip_all config will be applied to all linked targets.
   # If custom stripping parameters are required, remove that config from a
